    "title": "第5章 予想の彼方に見るもの",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 5: What Lies Beyond Predictions",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "ある日の放課後。図書室で、クロノジェネシスと\n彼女を遠くから見つめるウマ娘を見かけた。",
            "enText": "One day after school. In the library, I saw Chrono Genesis \nand a Horsegirl watching her from afar.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 120,
                    "pathId": -9202641391231905050
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8614882748640107160,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "うーん……。やっぱり、今のクロノちゃんって……。",
            "enText": "Hmm… Chrono right now really is…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 167,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノに用事かな？",
                    "enText": "Do you need something from Chrono?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -3278034490345410054
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3129064661109699004,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "クロノちゃんの……。はい、テスト用のノートを返しに来たんです。\n綺麗にまとまっててすごく助かったので、お礼を言いたくて……。",
            "enText": "You're Chrono's… Yes, I came to return her notebook for the test. It was so neatly organized and really helped me out, so I wanted to thank her…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 352,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -8455214084663820084
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8773508566552303740,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "でも、今のクロノちゃん、すっごく集中してるというか……。\nいつものお淑やかな感じとは違ったオーラを放ってて……。",
            "enText": "But right now, Chrono seems super focused… She's giving off an aura completely different from her usual graceful self…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 183,
                    "pathId": -4697292521090887185
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": 4011815147968371019
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6712432906684689323,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "ちょっとお邪魔になっちゃいそうで、声かけづらいっていうか……\nだけど、私、これから用事があるし……どうしよう？",
            "enText": "I feel like I'd be bothering her, so it's hard to call out… But I have something to do right after this… What should I do?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 352,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "それなら、俺が預かって渡しておくよ",
                    "enText": "<size=36>In that case, I can hold onto it and give it to her</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "それなら、私が預かって渡しておくよ",
                    "enText": "<size=36>In that case, I can hold onto it and give it to her</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": -6003242922575529189
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2510704873704186765,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "今回はダート1700、右回り……。注目を集めてるのは10番……。\n確かに、前走逃げ切り勝ちした先行力は目が離せない……。",
            "enText": "This time it's a 1700m dirt race, clockwise… The center of attention is number 10… It's true you can't ignore her early speed from when she pulled away for a win in her last race…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ねえねえ、クロノ",
                    "enText": "Hey there, Chrono",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 291,
                    "pathId": -6430742578494485425
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 267,
                    "pathId": 5222196592772415508
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4032971502441677974,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "けど、私が注目するのは6番……。ここ数戦は振るわないながら\n今回は距離短縮に加えて、バ場状態も――",
            "enText": "But the one I've got my eye on is number 6… Even though she hasn't been doing well in her last few races, this time the distance is shorter, plus the track condition is—",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 321,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もしも～し？",
                    "enText": "Hellooo?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": 1209488820222961538
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7501763046790600655
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 115,
                    "pathId": -4768220597883045704
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 133,
                    "pathId": 3749576123482913649
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -122938221876479273,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "ひゃ……！　と、トレーナーさん……。\nい、い、いつのまに……。",
            "enText": "Eep…! T-Trainer… \nW-W-When did you get here…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 196,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": -894752390341427882
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 2259532460304958084
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 279,
                    "pathId": -7432878343870003478
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": -6055307349850062218
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 240,
                    "pathId": 4159767455820846906
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 328,
                    "pathId": -912737725020673540
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4998506131582164803,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そ、そうでしたか……。代わりにこれを……。",
            "enText": "I-I see… So you brought this in her stead…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 164,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": 2479862216556694817
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": 5125424242150169180
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2197393481491367809
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -7378496991692151733
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -2378955433534449136
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2248378457531848995
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7898713109242454571,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "彼女には悪いことをしてしまいました……。\n予想を詰めていたら、つい夢中になってしまって……。",
            "enText": "I feel bad for ignoring her… I was narrowing down my predictions and got completely absorbed…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 282,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ちなみに、どのレースの予想をしていたの？",
                    "enText": "<size=36>By the way, which race were you predicting?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 317,
                    "pathId": 6236781768305756542
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 91,
                    "pathId": -5490537363029133705
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2111642369874550308,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えと……今日の種目別競技大会です。大体の予想は立てられたので、\nあとは直接仕上がりを見て、精度を高めたいと……。",
            "enText": "Umm… Today's individual event tournament. I've mostly formulated my predictions, so now I want to see their conditioning firsthand to improve the accuracy…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 358,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": 7164613565050507254
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 170,
                    "pathId": 3539819115820817117
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6603157116201150674,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……出走前のウォーミングアップ。\nそろそろ行かないと……！",
            "enText": "Ah… The pre-race warm-up. \nI need to get going…!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "面白そうだから、俺も一緒に行くよ",
                    "enText": "<size=40>That sounds interesting, I'll come with you</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "面白そうだから、私も一緒に行くよ",
                    "enText": "<size=40>That sounds interesting, I'll come with you</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 6172090306495725511
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": -8601734015575756479
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7638906248303024605,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……6番の仕上がり……予想通り……。\n10番のトモの運び……うん。これなら……。",
            "enText": "…Number 6's condition… Just as predicted… \nNumber 10's stride… Yeah. With this…",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 291,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "予想は決まった？",
                    "enText": "Have you finalized your predictions?",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 3718705963073777253
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 4116288825145251100
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 6835946880106588053
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": 7855767199537103764
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": -8607145343264096123
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": 218869356766852403
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2715687349891794739,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……はい。本命は6番。対抗で10番。\n1着は6番で堅く、10番、12番の2着争いが有力かと……！",
            "enText": "…Yes. The favorite is number 6. The rival is number 10. Number 6 is a solid bet for 1st, and the battle for 2nd will likely be between number 10 and number 12…!",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 334,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 191,
                    "pathId": 214763880567485047
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": 4116146186661239837
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7282922995319357257
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1743078574225832604
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": 4305912208527482204
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1333798879374792153,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "やがてウォーミングアップが終わり、\n選手たちが続々とゲートインする。だが――",
            "enText": "Eventually, the warm-up ended, and the competitors \nentered the gates one after another. However—",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 153,
                    "pathId": -1415135071538275751
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": -4482423311270366469
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5069656639563336471,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "（ポツッ……ポツッ……）",
            "enText": "(Pitter… patter…)",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 60,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（えっ！？雨……！？）",
                    "enText": "(Eh!? Rain…!?)",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -5525176126208030473
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -1090584890249928443
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8896301048393040570,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "急速に雲が空を覆い、スタートと同時に雨が降り出した。\n観戦者たちが右往左往しながら屋根の下へと避難する。",
            "enText": "Clouds rapidly covered the sky, and rain began to fall right as the race started. The spectators scrambled around, taking shelter under the roof.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……あれっ？クロノは？",
                    "enText": "…Huh? Where's Chrono?",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2861496940604527336,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "――6番は先行二番手……。重バ場で入着した経験もあるから、\n落ち着いた走り……。過去のレースから考えると……。",
            "enText": "—Number 6 is leading in second place… \nShe also has experience placing on a heavy track, \nso she's running calmly… Considering her past races…",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 248,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ、君も早く屋根の下へ……！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Chrono, you need to get under the roof, too…!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ、貴方も早く屋根の下へ……！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Chrono, you need to get under the roof, too…!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 268,
                    "pathId": -8272137188782841993
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -2342968628265299022
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5847800360832012037,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "いえ……！　ここです……！\n最前席がいいんです……！",
            "enText": "No…! I'm staying right here…! \nThe front row is best…!",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 87,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5684928737232527503
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 107,
                    "pathId": -2503639282947121590
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4465016743809519309,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "かつての歴史にも、様々な雨中の激戦がありました……！\nこのレースも、いずれそのような一戦に繋がるかもと思うと――",
            "enText": "History is filled with fierce battles fought in the rain…! \nJust thinking that this race might eventually become \none of those battles—",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 273,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 293,
                    "pathId": 6303120054661569027
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 201,
                    "pathId": 1975101240860009071
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1276389517742642837,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "目を離したくは、ないのです……！！",
            "enText": "I don't want to take my eyes off it…!!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ……",
                    "enText": "Chrono…",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": -6953760197498906869
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 93,
                    "pathId": -2628993730816870886
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3481059811094004505,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "歴史とは“絵”です。レースに携わる全ての者たちが描いた数多の\n“点”が繋がり、線になることで浮かび上がる――巨大な一枚絵。",
            "enText": "History is a \"picture.\" The countless \"dots\" drawn by everyone involved in racing connect, becoming lines that bring it to the surface—a massive, single picture.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": -6441773916721435286
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 636262106702819284
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": -914670444143323184
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4651790350787699054,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "以前、『歴史に魅入られた』と言っていた彼女。\n雨も厭わないこの情熱は、まさに魅入られたというべきもので――",
            "enText": "She had previously mentioned being \"captivated by history.\" This passion of hers, unbothered by the rain, proved just how captivated she truly was—",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 318,
                    "pathId": -1072338739590115456
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3865867357797979697,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えっ、ここで3番……！？\n6番の隙をついて……わっ！　わっ！",
            "enText": "Eh, number 3 is moving here…!? \nSlipping through number 6's opening… Wah! Wah!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 201,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 6068684714897478220
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 22,
                    "pathId": 3872579267184486933
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -2505390995498970476
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3551158436539487635,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "3番の……差し切り……！\n……すごい……！　すごい、すごいっ！！",
            "enText": "Number 3… snatched the win…! \n…Amazing…! Amazing, amazing!!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 235,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": 3687672034151423620
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": 5830633683656404706
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2701668986566454538,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "6番も重バ場の適性があったはず……！\nなのに、こちらの予想を覆して……はっ。この展開、確か……！！",
            "enText": "Number 6 should have had an aptitude for heavy track conditions too…! And yet, my predictions were overturned… Hah. This development, if I remember correctly…!!",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 324,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あっ、クロノ！",
                    "enText": "Ah, Chrono!",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 44663143732032067
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1650648879914132829
